@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = token
### List reservations (admin sees all, student sees own)
GET {{base}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only pending, newest first (admin approvals screen)
GET {{base}}/api/reservations?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only my own reservations
GET {{base}}/api/reservations?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One reservation
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Taken slots of a room in a date range
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/1/taken-slots?from=2026-11-09&to=2026-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a reservation (student token). Use a future date, 07:00-21:00.
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "faculty_id": "PASTE_FACULTY_USER_ID",
  "subject": "Capstone consultation",
  "reservation_date": "2026-11-12",
  "start_time": "13:00",
  "end_time": "15:00"
}

### Approve (admin token)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": true
}

### Reject with a reason (admin token)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": false,
  "reason": "Room is reserved for a department event."
}

### Cancel (owner or admin)
PATCH {{base}}/api/reservations/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
